  "id": "grilled-teriyaki-tuna",
  "name": "Grilled Teriyaki Tuna",
  "subtitle": "Marinated tuna cooked over a hot grill",
  "description": "Tuna fillets are coated in a savory teriyaki marinade, rested, and grilled until opaque and easily flaked.",
